    "show_share": true,
    "description": "In Sindh Province, SRC is contributing to improving MNCH services in collaboration with the Aga Khan University (AKU) in District Dadu, Sindh since 2012. This project (the third phase of MNCH Project) titled as \"Strengthening Maternal, Neonatal, Child and Adolescent Health Services (MNCAH Services) was conceived in 2019, as a follow up to the previous interventions with the addition of two new interventions, Menstrual Hygiene Management (MHM) and Safe Drinking Water.",
